# Signing materials (local debug only)
#
# debug.p12 / debug.cer / debug.csr were generated locally as key material.
# HarmonyOS personal debugging ALSO requires a profile (*.p7b) issued via
# Huawei developer account (DevEco automatic signing).
#
# Do this in DevEco Studio:
#   Project Structure → Signing Configs → Automatically generate signature
# That will write cert/profile paths into build-profile.json5.
#
# Never commit real release keys or store passwords to a public repo.
debug.p12
debug.cer
debug.csr
*.p7b
material/
